{"comment_text": {"ja68:0.1": "", "ja68:0.2": "", "ja68:0.3": "", "ja68:0.4": "", "ja68:1.1": "This only refers to events of the past, with no proper story. In the present, an old couple dotes on the Buddha as their son, and he confirms that they were his parents in many past lives. | The remaining stories of this chapter do not concern women. ", "ja68:1.2": "", "ja68:1.3": "", "ja68:1.4": "", "ja68:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja68:0.1": "<article id='ja68'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja68:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja68:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja68:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja68:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja68:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja68:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja68:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja68:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja68:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja68:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja68:0.3": "Itthivagga ", "ja68:0.4": "8. Sāketajātaka ", "ja68:1.1": "Yasmiṁ mano nivisati, ", "ja68:1.2": "cittañcāpi pasīdati; ", "ja68:1.3": "Adiṭṭhapubbake pose, ", "ja68:1.4": "kāmaṁ tasmimpi vissase”ti. ", "ja68:2.1": "Sāketajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja68:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 68 ", "ja68:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja68:0.3": "Women ", "ja68:0.4": "At Sāketa: a past life story ", "ja68:1.1": "In whom the mind settles, ", "ja68:1.2": "and the heart too is confident—", "ja68:1.3": "gladly one would trust in ", "ja68:1.4": "that man not seen before. ", "ja68:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja68:0.1": "", "ja68:0.2": "", "ja68:0.3": "", "ja68:0.4": "", "ja68:1.1": "", "ja68:1.2": "cittañcāpi → cittaṁ vāpi (bj) ", "ja68:1.3": "", "ja68:1.4": "", "ja68:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja68:0.1": "", "ja68:0.2": "", "ja68:0.3": "", "ja68:0.4": "", "ja68:1.1": "dr27.23, ms22J_149, msdiv68, pts-vp-pli1.309, sya27.22, vri68.16", "ja68:1.2": "", "ja68:1.3": "", "ja68:1.4": "", "ja68:2.1": "ms22J_150"}, "keys_order": ["ja68:0.1", "ja68:0.2", "ja68:0.3", "ja68:0.4", "ja68:1.1", "ja68:1.2", "ja68:1.3", "ja68:1.4", "ja68:2.1"]}